<mjml lang="fr">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Votre facture Memoria</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Votre facture Memoria est jointe à cet e-mail.</mj-preview>
    <mj-include path="./_tete.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#0b0b0b" width="600px">
    <mj-include path="./_entete.mjml" />
    <mj-wrapper background-color="#141111" border-top="3px solid #8a1316" padding="0">
      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="titre">VOTRE FACTURE</mj-text>
          <mj-divider border-color="#a9851a" border-width="1px" width="70px" padding="6px 0 24px" />
          <mj-text>Bonjour,</mj-text>
          <mj-text padding="12px 32px 0">Vous trouverez votre facture jointe à cet e-mail, au format PDF.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section padding="0 32px 22px">
        <mj-column background-color="#1a1515" padding="18px 22px">
          <mj-text padding="0" font-size="16px" line-height="1.7"><span class="libelle">Facture</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;{{var:invoice.reference:""}}<br><span class="libelle">Commande</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;{{var:invoice.order.reference:""}}<br><span class="libelle">Date</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;{{var:invoice.dateFormatted:""}}<br><span class="libelle">Restant dû</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;{{var:invoiceAmountDueFormatted:""}}<br><span class="libelle">Échéance</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;{{var:invoice.dueDateFormatted:""}}</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section padding="10px 0 34px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text>Une question ? Appelez-nous au <a href="tel:+33665718707">06&nbsp;65&nbsp;71&nbsp;87&nbsp;07</a> ou écrivez-nous à <a href="mailto:contact@memoria-experience.fr">contact@memoria-experience.fr</a>.</mj-text>
          <mj-text padding="12px 32px 0" font-family="Metamorphous, Georgia, serif" color="#ece6da">L’équipe Memoria</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
    </mj-wrapper>
    <mj-include path="./_pied.mjml" />
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
